# {{amino acid}} An [[essential amino acid]] C<sub>9</sub>H<sub>11</sub>NO<sub>2</sub> found in most [[animal]] [[protein]]s; it is essential for [[growth]]; the [[inability]] to [[metabolize]] it leads to [[phenylketonuria]]; it is a [[constituent]] of [[aspartame]].

